# {{ tiles.title }}

One item per (MGRS square, year), each carrying twelve single-band
Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs on the 10 km MGRS grid at 10 m grid spacing, in that
square's own UTM zone. Agents: read [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

